from.markdown:
`import` gives you all of a template's macros under one name. `from` imports chosen macros by name, optionally with an alias:

---

```kiln
{% import "macros/forms" as forms %}
{% from "macros/forms" import input, textarea as area %}
```

import.markdown:
`import` gives you all of a template's macros under one name. `from` imports chosen macros by name, optionally with an alias:

